{"s":97,"v":[{"t":"Indeed, We sent it [i.e., the Qur’ān] down during the Night of Decree.","w":[["إِنَّآ","Indeed, We","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["آ",11]]],["أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","revealed it","anzalnāhu","",[["أَنزَلْ",77],["نَ",11],["ـٰهُ",5]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["لَيْلَةِ","(the) Night","laylati",""],["ٱلْقَدْرِ","(of) Power","l-qadri","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَدْرِ",1095]]]]},{"t":"And what can make you know what is the Night of Decree?","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَدْرَىٰكَ","can make you know","adrāka","",[["أَدْرَىٰ",558],["كَ",18]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["لَيْلَةُ","(the) Night","laylatu",""],["ٱلْقَدْرِ","(of) Power (is)","l-qadri","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَدْرِ",1095]]]]},{"t":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months.","w":[["لَيْلَةُ","(The) Night","laylatu",""],["ٱلْقَدْرِ","(of) Power","l-qadri","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَدْرِ",1095]]],["خَيْرٌۭ","(is) better","khayrun",""],["مِّنْ","than","min",""],["أَلْفِ","a thousand","alfi",""],["شَهْرٍۢ","month(s)","shahrin",""]]},{"t":"The angels and the Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] descend therein by permission of their Lord for every matter.","w":[["تَنَزَّلُ","Descend","tanazzalu",""],["ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","the Angels","l-malāikatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ",143]]],["وَٱلرُّوحُ","and the Spirit","wal-rūḥu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["رُّوحُ",488]]],["فِيهَا","therein","fīhā","",[["فِي",14],["هَا",22]]],["بِإِذْنِ","by (the) permission","bi-idh'ni","",[["بِ",10],["إِذْنِ",311]]],["رَبِّهِم","(of) their Lord","rabbihim","",[["رَبِّ",24],["هِم",3]]],["مِّن","for","min",""],["كُلِّ","every","kulli",""],["أَمْرٍۢ","affair","amrin",""]]},{"t":"Peace it is until the emergence of dawn.","w":[["سَلَـٰمٌ","Peace","salāmun",""],["هِىَ","it (is)","hiya",""],["حَتَّىٰ","until","ḥattā",""],["مَطْلَعِ","(the) emergence","maṭlaʿi",""],["ٱلْفَجْرِ","(of) the dawn","l-fajri","",[["ٱلْ",2],["فَجْرِ",1199]]]]}]}